#. module: library
#: model_terms:product.template,description:library.product_product_20_product_template
msgid ""
"Digitally remastered edition of this 1964 U.S.-only album from the Fab Four "
"housed in a replica mini LP sleeve. The artwork includes all aspects of the "
"original artwork right down to the inner sleeve! The U.S. albums were either "
"condensed versions of their UK counterparts or were albums created for the "
"U.S. market consisting of stray album tracks and singles. In this case the "
"U.S. soundtrack includes tracks performed in the film by The Beatles as well "
"as incidental orchestral music from the film."
msgstr ""
"Edisi digitally remastered dari album rilisan khusus AS tahun 1964 milik Fab "
"Four, kini hadir dalam kemasan replika mini LP sleeve yang memikat. Sentuhan "
"visualnya dibuat sangat mendetail mereplikasi seluruh elemen karya seni "
"aslinya, hingga ke bagian inner sleeve! Rilisan AS kala itu umumnya hadir "
"sebagai versi yang lebih padat dari album rilisan Inggris, atau memang "
"dirancang khusus untuk pasar Amerika dengan memuat trek album pilihan dan "
"lagu-lagu rilisan tunggal. Untuk album ini sendiri, versi soundtrack AS "
"menyajikan kombinasi apik antara lagu-lagu yang dibawakan langsung oleh The "
"Beatles dalam film, serta alunan musik orkestra pengiring yang memukau."

